---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
import Pulse from "./Pulse.astro";
---

<Card
  colSpan="md:col-span-1"
  rowSpan="md:row-span-2"
  padding="py-3 px-5"
  nsPadY="0.75rem"
  centerY
>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center w-full">
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
        <h2 class="text-white text-lg font-bold m-0">
          <span class="lang-en">Now</span>
          <span class="lang-fa">در حال حاضر</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <span class="text-3xs text-darkslate-300">2026</span>
        <Pulse />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lang-en text-2xs text-darkslate-100 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
      <p class="m-0">
        • Working as an <b class="text-white">Art Director</b> on a mixed-media animation project.
      </p>
      <p class="m-0">
        • Working on a 2D animation project as a <b class="text-white">Concept Artist & AI Artist</b>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="lang-fa text-2xs text-darkslate-100 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
      <p class="m-0">
        • فعالیت به عنوان <b class="text-white">کارگردان هنری (Art Director)</b> در یک پروژه انیمیشن با تکنیک میکس‌مدیا.
      </p>
      <p class="m-0">
        • فعالیت در یک پروژه انیمیشن دوبعدی به عنوان <b class="text-white">کانسپت آرتیست و AI Artist</b>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Card>
